      <dt>Outcome</dt><dd>One consistent flow of data.</dd></dl>
      <span class="tag built">Built</span></article>
    <article><h3>Data &amp; Knowledge Systems</h3>
      <dl><dt>Problem</dt><dd>Knowledge is scattered and hard to query.</dd>
      <dt>Solution</dt><dd>Structured storage and retrieval pipelines (RAG).</dd>
      <dt>Tools</dt><dd class="mono">PostgreSQL, pgvector</dd>
      <dt>Outcome</dt><dd>Answers grounded in the company's own sources.</dd></dl>
      <span class="tag explore">Exploring</span></article>
    <article><h3>Deployment &amp; Implementation</h3>
      <dl><dt>Problem</dt><dd>Prototypes that never reach production.</dd>
      <dt>Solution</dt><dd>Containerised services with documented setup.</dd>
      <dt>Tools</dt><dd class="mono">Docker, Compose, Linux</dd>
      <dt>Outcome</dt><dd>Repeatable deployment, clear runbooks.</dd></dl>
      <span class="tag built">Built</span></article>
  </div>
</section>

