<section class="wrap" id="approach">
  <h2>Engineering approach</h2>
  <p class="lead2">Useful, testable and maintainable beats impressive and unusable.</p>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><b>Discover</b>Understand the need, users, constraints and how work happens today.</li>
    <li><b>Design</b>Define architecture, integrations, data model and success criteria.</li>
    <li><b>Build &amp; Integrate</b>Develop components, connect services, test interactions, handle errors.</li>
    <li><b>Deploy &amp; Improve</b>Ship, document, check reliability, iterate on feedback.</li>
  </ol>
</section>

